 171:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     Exception done MspInit / MspDeInit that can be registered / unregistered
 172:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     in HAL_TIM_STATE_READY or HAL_TIM_STATE_RESET state,
