2614:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****                         ##### TIM One Pulse functions #####
2615:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   ==============================================================================
2616:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   [..]
2617:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     This section provides functions allowing to:
2618:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Initialize and configure the TIM One Pulse.
2619:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) De-initialize the TIM One Pulse.
2620:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Start the TIM One Pulse.
2621:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Stop the TIM One Pulse.
2622:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Start the TIM One Pulse and enable interrupt.
2623:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Stop the TIM One Pulse and disable interrupt.
2624:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Start the TIM One Pulse and enable DMA transfer.
2625:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Stop the TIM One Pulse and disable DMA transfer.
