2821:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   /* Enable the Capture compare and the Input Capture channels
2822:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     (in the OPM Mode the two possible channels that can be used are TIM_CHANNEL_1 and TIM_CHANNEL_2
2823:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     if TIM_CHANNEL_1 is used as output, the TIM_CHANNEL_2 will be used as input and
2824:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     if TIM_CHANNEL_1 is used as input, the TIM_CHANNEL_2 will be used as output
2825:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****     whatever the combination, the TIM_CHANNEL_1 and TIM_CHANNEL_2 should be enabled together
2826:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c **** 
