5622:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c **** /**
5623:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Selects the signal connected to the TI1 input: direct from CH1_input
5624:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         or a XOR combination between CH1_input, CH2_input & CH3_input
5625:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  htim TIM handle.
