7530:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c **** /**
7531:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Configure the TI1 as Input.
7532:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIMx to select the TIM peripheral.
7533:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICPolarity The Input Polarity.
7534:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
7535:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICPOLARITY_RISING
7536:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICPOLARITY_FALLING
7537:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICPOLARITY_BOTHEDGE
7538:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICSelection specifies the input to be used.
